  "applies_to": "Measurlogic DTS MCM enclosures with 3, 4, 6 or 8 DTS 307 meters (9 to 24 circuits) and a DTS E4C BACnet IP / Modbus TCP gateway.",
  "summary": "The DTS MCM is a weatherproof multi-circuit sub-metering enclosure: 3 to 8 three-circuit DTS 307 meters, breakers and a DTS E4C Ethernet module that serves all meters as one BACnet IP device. Common voltage and frequency objects come first, then one group of current, power, power factor, demand and energy objects for each meter. This entry lists the common objects and meter 1, as printed; the other meters repeat the meter 1 group.",
