    "BACnet IP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": 473001,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Meter groups 2 to N follow the printed pattern: instance 1n01-1n54 and names with _n_ (e.g. meter 3 total power = AI 1310, PowerP_3_Tot). N is 3, 4, 6 or 8 for the 9C, 12C, 18C and 24C models.",
    "Only the common objects and meter 1 are listed here, as printed in the map; the other groups are not generated.",
    "The map lists no access column; all listed objects are measurements and shown read-only. The device ID is changed on the BACnet Settings web page.",
    "Power factor objects have no units printed."
  ],
